# Dstl8 CLI Usage Note

This file is Ansible-managed by the `dstl8_cli` role.

## What Dstl8 Is

Dstl8 is a terminal-native CLI and TUI for continuous runtime feedback. It can
distill, detect, correlate, and explain incidents across deployment and
observability surfaces such as Kubernetes, AWS CloudWatch, Vercel, Supabase,
GitHub, and OpenTelemetry. It also provides an MCP server so AI coding tools
can investigate incidents and query runtime context directly.

